<title>FRANCE: Societe Generale holds less than 5 pct in Havas.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale holds less than 5 pct in Havas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CMF French financial markets council said on Monday that it had received a declaration for bank Societe Generale (SocGen) that it now held less than five percent in media group Havas.</p>
<p>On July 4, Societe Generale and its Delahaye Generale Options and Geneval units sold Havas shares.</p>
<p>The group now has a total 4.645 percent stake. It did not give the previous holding.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
